<title>USA: Dailey says calls off merger with Phoenix.</title>
<headline>Dailey says calls off merger with Phoenix.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dailey Petroleum Services Corp said Tuesday that it mutually agreed with Phoenix Drilling Services Inc to terminate their merger agreement.</p>
<p>Under terms of the deal, announced last month, Dailey had agreed to purchase all of the outstanding stock of Phoenix for $67 million cash.</p>
<p>A Dailey spokeswoman said the two companies were unable to come to final terms on the deal following completion of due diligence. She declined to offer further specifics.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
